{"id":55231,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=55231"},"modified":"2026-10-19T00:03:31","modified_gmt":"2026-10-18T23:03:31","slug":"ladeira-on-fire","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/ladeira-on-fire\/","title":{"rendered":"Ladeira on Fire 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Ladeira on Fire 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Ladeira on Fire 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>28 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com in\u00edcio \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, na emblem\u00e1tica <strong>Ladeira da Nazar\u00e9<\/strong>, no concelho da <strong>Nazar\u00e9<\/strong> e distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>. Esta prova de resist\u00eancia e supera\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 dedicada exclusivamente a <strong>Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios, Sapadores e Municipais<\/strong>, desafiando um limite m\u00e1ximo de 200 operacionais a vencerem a \u00edngreme subida nazarena envergando o equipamento completo de prote\u00e7\u00e3o individual.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Num cen\u00e1rio \u00fanico junto ao promont\u00f3rio do <strong>S\u00edtio da Nazar\u00e9<\/strong> e ao <strong>Forte de S\u00e3o Miguel Arcanjo<\/strong> \u2014 mundialmente famoso pelo Canh\u00e3o da Nazar\u00e9 e pelas suas ondas gigantes \u2014, cada participante enfrenta o declive exigente da Ladeira da Nazar\u00e9 equipado com <strong>EPI Urbano completo<\/strong> (fato completo, pe\u00e7a facial, aparelho respirat\u00f3rio <strong>ARICA<\/strong>, capacete, cogula e luvas). A competi\u00e7\u00e3o apura a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o geral masculina e feminina, bem como sete escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (dos 18 aos +60 anos), atribuindo medalha <em>finisher<\/em> a todos os participantes, trof\u00e9us por escal\u00e3o e um pr\u00e9mio exclusivo para o melhor tempo absoluto.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios da Nazar\u00e9<\/strong>, o evento conta com secretariado no Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios da Nazar\u00e9 (a partir das 07:00 no dia da prova), abastecimento de \u00e1gua, banhos e servi\u00e7o de massagem no final. A jornada culmina num conv\u00edvio e <strong>almo\u00e7o solid\u00e1rio<\/strong> composto por sardinhas assadas e sopa da pedra, celebrando o esp\u00edrito de corpo, a coragem e a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o dos bombeiros portugueses.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">28 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Ladeira da Nazar\u00e9, Leiria<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Subida da Ladeira da Nazar\u00e9 (Prova Exclusiva para Bombeiros com EPI Urbano + ARICA)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios da Nazar\u00e9<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1_JvKSXiDehSfOdZcfkvA0BbMDLR7kcTZ\/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Desafio Bombeiros<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Ladeira on Fire (EPI Urbano + ARICA)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 28 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Oficial:<\/strong> 10.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">C\/ T-shirt Oficial:<\/strong> 20.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Premium (c\/ T-shirt e Almo\u00e7o):<\/strong> 25.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"><\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data, hora e local do Ladeira on Fire 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O Ladeira on Fire 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 28 de novembro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 09:00 na Ladeira da Nazar\u00e9 (concelho da Nazar\u00e9, distrito de Leiria).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem pode participar e qual \u00e9 o equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio na prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A competi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 exclusiva para Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios, Sapadores e Municipais, estando limitada a um m\u00e1ximo de 200 participantes. Todos os atletas devem competir envergando o EPI Urbano completo: fato completo, pe\u00e7a facial, aparelho respirat\u00f3rio (ARICA), capacete, cogula e luvas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as modalidades e pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Existem tr\u00eas modalidades de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o (denominadas &#8216;Capacetes&#8217;): 10,00 \u20ac (10 Capacetes) para a Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Oficial base; 20,00 \u20ac (20 Capacetes) para Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o com T-shirt Oficial; e 25,00 \u20ac (25 Capacetes) para a Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Premium, que inclui a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o na prova, T-shirt Oficial e o almo\u00e7o solid\u00e1rio de sardinhas assadas e sopa da pedra com bebidas e caf\u00e9.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde funciona o secretariado e que apoio log\u00edstico est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento de dorsais decorre nos dias anteriores e no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (28 de novembro) a partir das 07:00, no Quartel dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios da Nazar\u00e9. A log\u00edstica da prova assegura abastecimento de \u00e1gua, banhos e servi\u00e7o de massagem no final da presta\u00e7\u00e3o.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Ladeira on Fire 2026 e como funcionam os escal\u00f5es e pr\u00e9mios?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios da Nazar\u00e9. Existem classifica\u00e7\u00f5es gerais (masculina e feminina) e sete escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios (Escal\u00e3o A: 18-29 anos; B: 30-39; C: 40-44; D: 45-49; E: 50-54; F: 55-59; G: +60 anos), com entrega de medalha finisher, trof\u00e9us aos melhores classificados e um pr\u00e9mio exclusivo para o melhor tempo da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Ladeira on Fire 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-28\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Ladeira da Nazar\u00e9\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Nazar\u00e9\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Humanit\u00e1ria dos Bombeiros Volunt\u00e1rios da Nazar\u00e9\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data, hora e local do Ladeira on Fire 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O Ladeira on Fire 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 28 de novembro de 2026, com partida marcada para as 09:00 na Ladeira da Nazar\u00e9 (concelho da Nazar\u00e9, distrito de Leiria).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quem pode participar e qual \u00e9 o equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio na prova?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"